# R8 keep rules for the release build (AGP combines every file in src/main/keepRules).
# https://d.android.com/r/tools/r8/keep-rules

# WorkManager (partner sharing sync) keeps its jobs in a Room database. Room creates it by
# reflection, through the no-argument constructor of the generated WorkDatabase_Impl. Room 2.6's own
# rule keeps the class but not that constructor, and R8's full mode then removes it: the release
# app crashed at start ("NoSuchMethodException: androidx.work.impl.WorkDatabase_Impl.<init>").
-keep class * extends androidx.room.RoomDatabase { <init>(); }
